From 4ad33ca195ad757ecca35fb9c4df2416f52d0477 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Play as Ganondorf <infectiousmetal@live.se>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 03:53:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add "Play as Ganondorf" extra mode

Replaces Link with Ganondorf from the Ganon's Tower fight, using his boss
moveset instead of Link's. Link stays underneath, invisible, for movement,
collision, doors and the camera; BossGanon gets a player-controlled mode
(params GDF_PARAMS_PLAYER) that follows him and does the attacking:

- B: light ball, hold B to charge Big Magic (5 homing balls)
- R: cape block (intangible), R + B: pound the floor (shockwave)
- C-Left / C-Down / C-Right: light ball / pound / Big Magic

His attacks carry every damage type. CollisionCheck_ApplyDamage picks the
best damage-table entry the target accepts (plain damage first, elemental
only when needed), and Actor_GetCollidedExplosive treats his attacks as
explosions so Beamos, Bubbles and bomb-only walls react to them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013T33i9bqPBYx7ji29wpyEN
